<p>(blob)</p>
</div></blockquote>
<p>M -&gt; (map)</p>
<blockquote>
<div><p>An attribute of type Map. For example:</p>
<blockquote>
<div><code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">&quot;M&quot;:</span> <span class="pre">{&quot;Name&quot;:</span> <span class="pre">{&quot;S&quot;:</span> <span class="pre">&quot;Joe&quot;},</span> <span class="pre">&quot;Age&quot;:</span> <span class="pre">{&quot;N&quot;:</span> <span class="pre">&quot;35&quot;}}</span></code></div></blockquote>
<p>key -&gt; (string)</p>
