<p>ScannedCount -&gt; (integer)</p>
<blockquote>
<div><p>The number of items evaluated, before any <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">QueryFilter</span></code> is applied. A high <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">ScannedCount</span></code> value with few, or no, <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Count</span></code> results indicates an inefficient <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Query</span></code> operation. For more information, see <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/developerguide/Scan.html#Scan.Count">Count and ScannedCount</a> in the <em>Amazon DynamoDB Developer Guide</em> .</p>
