<p>If <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">LastEvaluatedKey</span></code> is empty, then the “last page” of results has been processed and there is no more data to be retrieved.</p>
<p>If <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">LastEvaluatedKey</span></code> is not empty, it does not necessarily mean that there is more data in the result set. The only way to know when you have reached the end of the result set is when <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">LastEvaluatedKey</span></code> is empty.</p>
